Route19_Text_RichardIntro::
    .string "I warm up before\n"
    .string "every swim.\p"
    .string "Today my Pokemon\n"
    .string "refused to enter\p"
    .string "the water.$"

Route19_Text_RichardDefeat::
    .string "They saw something.$"

Route19_Text_RichardPostBattle::
    .string "I went in anyway.\p"
    .string "I shouldn't have.$"

Route19_Text_ReeceIntro::
    .string "Slow down.\p"
    .string "The water here\n"
    .string "moves differently\p"
    .string "than it should.\p"
    .string "Something beneath\n"
    .string "pushes against\p"
    .string "the current.$"

Route19_Text_ReeceDefeat::
    .string "Still pushing.$"

Route19_Text_ReecePostBattle::
    .string "Swim steady.\p"
    .string "Don't let it\n"
    .string "feel your rhythm.$"

Route19_Text_MatthewIntro::
    .string "I love swimming.\p"
    .string "This water loves\n"
    .string "something else.\p"
    .string "I can feel it\n"
    .string "passing beneath me.$"

Route19_Text_MatthewDefeat::
    .string "It felt you too.$"

Route19_Text_MatthewPostBattle::
    .string "Keep moving.\p"
    .string "Don't float still\n"
    .string "in this water.$"

Route19_Text_DouglasIntro::
    .string "What's beyond\n"
    .string "the horizon?\p"
    .string "I swam toward it\n"
    .string "yesterday.\p"
    .string "The horizon moved away.\p"
    .string "Something else\n"
    .string "came closer.$"

Route19_Text_DouglasDefeat::
    .string "It's closer now.$"

Route19_Text_DouglasPostBattle::
    .string "Don't chase\n"
    .string "what moves away\p"
    .string "from you here.$"

Route19_Text_DavidIntro::
    .string "I tried diving\n"
    .string "for Pokemon.\p"
    .string "Something below\n"
    .string "dived back up\p"
    .string "toward me.\p"
    .string "I came back up faster.$"

Route19_Text_DavidDefeat::
    .string "It's still down there.$"

Route19_Text_DavidPostBattle::
    .string "Don't dive in\n"
    .string "these waters.\p"
    .string "The bottom is\n"
    .string "deeper than the maps say.$"

Route19_Text_TonyIntro::
    .string "I look at the\n"
    .string "sea to forget\p"
    .string "bad things.\p"
    .string "The sea started\n"
    .string "looking back.\p"
    .string "Now I remember everything.$"

Route19_Text_TonyDefeat::
    .string "Everything.$"

Route19_Text_TonyPostBattle::
    .string "Don't stare at\n"
    .string "this water too long.\p"
    .string "It shows you things.$"

Route19_Text_AnyaIntro::
    .string "I love your ride.\p"
    .string "I've been treading\n"
    .string "water for an hour.\p"
    .string "I can't reach\n"
    .string "the shore.\p"
    .string "Beat me and\n"
    .string "maybe I can move.$"

Route19_Text_AnyaDefeat::
    .string "I'm moving.$"

Route19_Text_AnyaPostBattle::
    .string "Thank you.\p"
    .string "Whatever was holding\n"
    .string "me let go.$"

Route19_Text_AliceIntro::
    .string "Swimming is great.\p"
    .string "This water is cold\n"
    .string "in places it\p"
    .string "shouldn't be cold.\p"
    .string "Moving cold.\p"
    .string "Like something breathing.$"

Route19_Text_AliceDefeat::
    .string "Still breathing.$"

Route19_Text_AlicePostBattle::
    .string "Swim fast through\n"
    .string "the cold spots.\p"
    .string "Don't stop in them.$"

Route19_Text_AxleIntro::
    .string "These waters are\n"
    .string "treacherous.\p"
    .string "Not from the current.\p"
    .string "From what moves\n"
    .string "through it at night.$"

Route19_Text_AxleDefeat::
    .string "You'll see tonight.$"

Route19_Text_AxlePostBattle::
    .string "Stay on the\n"
    .string "surface.\p"
    .string "Don't wonder what's below.$"

Route19_Text_ConnieIntro::
    .string "I swam here\n"
    .string "with friends.\p"
    .string "We got separated.\p"
    .string "The water between us\n"
    .string "was warm.\p"
    .string "They were close.\p"
    .string "Then they weren't.$"

Route19_Text_ConnieDefeat::
    .string "I'm still looking.$"

Route19_Text_ConniePostBattle::
    .string "Don't swim here\n"
    .string "with people you\p"
    .string "want to keep.$"

Route19_Text_RouteSign::
    .string "SEA ROUTE 19\n"
    .string "FUCHSIA CITY - SEAFOAM ISLANDS$"

Route19_Text_LiaIntro::
    .string "LIA: I'm looking after\n"
    .string "my brother.\p"
    .string "LIA: Something in this\n"
    .string "water has been\p"
    .string "looking after us.\p"
    .string "LIA: I don't know\n"
    .string "what it wants.$"

Route19_Text_LiaDefeat::
    .string "LIA: It's still watching.$"

Route19_Text_LiaPostBattle::
    .string "LIA: As long as\n"
    .string "we keep moving\p"
    .string "it keeps its distance.$"

Route19_Text_LiaNotEnoughMons::
    .string "LIA: I want to battle together\n"
    .string "with my little brother.\p"
    .string "Don't you have two POKéMON?$"

Route19_Text_LucIntro::
    .string "LUC: My sister taught\n"
    .string "me to swim.\p"
    .string "LUC: Something in the\n"
    .string "water tried to\p"
    .string "teach me something else.\p"
    .string "LUC: I didn't learn it.$"

Route19_Text_LucDefeat::
    .string "LUC: Good.$"

Route19_Text_LucPostBattle::
    .string "LUC: Don't learn anything\n"
    .string "the water tries\p"
    .string "to teach you.$"

Route19_Text_LucNotEnoughMons::
    .string "LUC: I don't want to if I can't\n"
    .string "battle you with my big sis.\p"
    .string "Don't you have two POKéMON?$"
